     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\nHi Stephanie,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>The trees from MCMC sampling after burnin and thinning are stored in a list with name <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">samptreethin</span>.\r\n You can get each posterior tree from this list. Each tree has its elements which are specified in our vignettes. You can get the standard errors from the posteriors of the tree elements.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Hope that this helps you and please feel free to let me know if you have further questions.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Best,</div>\r\n<div>Yuchao</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<div>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div>On Mar 22, 2017, at 10:08 AM, Stefanie Friedrich &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">stefanie....@dbb.su.se</a>&gt; wrote:</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-left:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<font face=\"Sawasdee\">Dear Yuchao Jiang,</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-left:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\">Thank you for your fast reply<font face=\"Sawasdee\"><span> </span>and the information<font face=\"Sawasdee\"><span> </span>you\r\n sent.</font></font></font></font></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-left:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\">Bootstrapping<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\">would\r\n show<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\"><font face=\"Sawasdee\">h<font face=\"Sawasdee\">ow str<font face=\"Sawasdee\">ong the support for a<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\">clade\r\n is</font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font>. Moreover, the values make trees<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\">compara<font face=\"Sawasdee\">ble even if<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\">built\r\n with<span> </span></font>different input data sets<font face=\"Sawasdee\">. The standard error would also help<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\">me<font face=\"Sawasdee\">,</font><span> </span>although<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\">it<span> </span></font>depends\r\n on the<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\">input data set size.</font></font></font></font></font></font>I tried to find th<font face=\"Sawasdee\">e standard error in the code<font face=\"Sawasdee\">.<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\">Where\r\n is the<span> </span><font face=\"Sawasdee\">value</font><span> </span>hidden?</font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-left:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<font face=\"Sawasdee\">Kind regards</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-left:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<font face=\"Sawasdee\">Stefanie</font><br>\r\n</p></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
