     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>\r\n<br style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nOn 2017-03-16 16:30, Jiang, Yuchao wrote:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Hi Stefanie,<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">I’m not familiar with the newick format but the tree in Canopy is coded as a list embedded with tree elements and is plotted using R package ape. I am not sure\r\n why you want to use bootstrap on the tree, but if you want to get the confidence intervals or standard errors, since we are using the MCMC sampling procedure, you can get these by looking at the posterior distribution after binning and thinning. If you still\r\n want bootstrap, you will most likely have to code yourself from the tree, which again, is a list object in R.<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Hope that this clarifies! I am cc’ing our mailing list in case other users have similar questions.<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Best,<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Yuchao<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<br style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
